{"t": 1793318552178, "cmd": "note", "args": ["E silently does nothing when debris is close at your feet but the view is level-ish: fallen shingle 0.9m away at bearing -2 deg, pitch -42 deg, crosshair label 'Floorboards' (not in reach); E gave no pickup and no message. Tilting to pitch -71 so the label read 'Fallen shingle' made E work. The horizontal 12-deg leniency does not seem to cover pitch, and a failed E has no 'nothing in reach' feedback. Screenshot shots/e_silent.png (tick ~9555)."]}
